 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 534295,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Find the sum of the measures of the exterior angles in the figure shown.\n<figure>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/55bb14bbb604aec8.png\" alt=\"A heptagon, A B C D E F G. The exterior angles are marked at each vertex.\">\n</figure>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The sum of the measures of the exterior angles of a regular polygon with <i>n</i> sides equals 360°.</p>\n<p>You could stop there. The measure of each of a regular polygon with <i>n</i> sides is <span data-math=\"b = \\frac{{360^\\circ }}{n}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>A heptagon has seven sides, so <i>n</i> = 7.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"b = \\frac{{360^\\circ }}{n} = \\frac{{360^\\circ }}{7} \\approx 51.43^\\circ \"></span></p>\n<p>To get back to the sum of all the exterior angles, multiply by 7.</p>\n<p>7(51.43) is approximately 360°.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"7(51.43) = {360^ \\circ }\">7(51.43) = {360^ \\circ }</span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
